Business Rules
Debit
New balance = Current balance - Amount

Debit is rejected when:

Current balance < Amount

Response:

409 Conflict
ACC-006
Credit
New balance = Current balance + Amount
Account status

Only an ACTIVE account can be debited or credited.

INACTIVE, BLOCKED, and CLOSED accounts return:

409 Conflict
